    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After a courageous casting choice that challenged convention, the director who championed inclusive storytelling faced a vicious assault on the production from aggressors who launched a targeted attack on the film. These vocal critics in the debate leveled charges of erasing European history, but champions of diverse casting rallied to protect the artistic vision, presenting a defense of inclusive interpretation. The conflict exposed the stakes of cultural ownership, transforming a mythic epic into a cultural battleground over identity and belonging.",
