    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The performers cast in the adaptation found themselves at the center of a major cultural dispute when public figures expressing criticism made public accusations about historical portrayal. However, supporters who argued for inclusion articulated a principled stand for universal access to stories, countering the intense public backlash. This ideological conflict ignited a battle for the soul of storytelling, sparking a public dispute over who may claim classical narratives in mass-market film.",
